gYe4rMtL9L20rXfhOQ22XRL105XgkLnUp7YCYciaDlVJ6awx15yR904Ly5bubyV6vw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L2WoHqic18T3TR3pDEZOjgMGNu1hoblKvEn44SAdYxbOglE21J6CYu3yg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L2HTFLgDwDuicpF7creNBSvYUgHknnW9pVZDe0iaibicHwibWuwYjoetRdzibQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L2ksYYgJUkbgwiasFSujDkoz5gndFBNoS0WZufNkS7m2XnwuuiaFzv1Q2g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L27AZusOjDEJPcNicBsQM7Z9d5DGRqEHYYtMA3dRy3e9XFXobh42zIIew/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L2MSqLM28HoniamlDuUictxTIQ8j0Bdm0CRIlpEvWONgo3m5a87AUsTibwA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L2Udryib4r7jhLlQEBXFBPM62ianfPxicIAwibBibCnljnoPJuUAicevcWd0DA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>能源与动力工程学院是华中科技大学前身之一的华中工学院1952年建校时创办的院（系）之一，其动力工程及工程热物理是首批一级国家重点学科，首批入选国家“双一流”建设学科，拥有以煤燃烧与低碳利用全国重点实验室等10个国家级工程实践中心等为支撑的学科体系。建院以来，共培养出2.7万余名莘莘学子，涌现出一批以院士、杰出企业家等为代表的学界泰斗、政界精英、科研翘楚、产业领袖，为服务国民经济和社会发展贡献智慧与力量。</span></p><p><span>为促进全国各高校大学生之间的交流，增强对能源与动力工程学院的了解，提升学生科学研究热情。能源与动力工程学院热能工程专业（煤燃烧与低碳利用全国重点实验室）及动力机械及工程专业拟定于2025年7月4日—7月6日举办“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>具体介绍</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>一、夏令营申请专业和名额</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营拟共招收60人，其中热能工程专业40人，动力机械及工程专业20人。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.热能工程</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>主要研究能源（热能）的低碳、高效、清洁利用与转换，节能新技术、新工艺（流程）、新设备和新材料的开发等。研究方向包括：能源低碳利用的多相反应流基础理论、二氧化碳捕集利用与封存（CCUS）、化石能源灵活高效清洁发电关键技术、多能互补与智慧协同的低碳能源系统、热力设备与系统的诊断、优化与综合评价。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2.动力机械及工程</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>以内燃机、燃气轮机、燃料电池和正在发展中的其它新型动力机械及其系统为对象，主要研究方向有：发动机先进燃烧理论、节能和排放控制与清洁燃烧技术、低碳燃料及低碳燃料发动机技术、新能源汽车动力及智能控制、发动机复杂流动计算与现代涡轮增压技术、动力机械结构强度分析、有限元可靠性理论，电控管理与汽车电子控制技术等。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、申请资格</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.全国一流大学或一流学科建设高校相关专业（能源与动力类、新能源等）本科三年级在校生（预期可获得所在学校推免资格，2026届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优秀，思想表现优良,心理健康（前三年或者前五学期学习成绩要求：一流大学预期获得推免资格者，一流学科高校成绩排名在前10%，若其他方面有突出表现，可适当放宽排名限制）。</span></p><p><span>3.英语水平良好（通过英语6级或相当水平）。</span></p><p><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，未受过任何处分。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、申请材料</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.个人简历1份。</span></p><p><span>2.本科阶段成绩单及排名证明1份（由教务部门盖章），有条件的可提供院系或导师推荐意见，将会择优考虑。</span></p><p><span>3.获奖证书复印件各1份。</span></p><p><span>4.国家英语六级考试成绩、或TOEFL成绩、或GRE/GMAT成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明1份。</span></p><p><span>5.申请人还可提交体现自身水平的代表性论文、出版物或原创性工作成果(如专利、发明、制作、软件等)。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>四、申请方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.网上报名</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人登录华中科技大学研究生招生系统--学术夏令营，地址为：</span></p></section><section><p><span>http://yanzhao.hust.edu.cn/</span></p></section><section><p><span>报名时，将材料1-5的文档/或扫描件/或PDF按要求上传报名系统。申请材料不用邮寄，不接收纸质材料。</span></p><p><span>报名时间：6月6日至6月20日23:00，过期报名不予受理。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2.材料审核及录取</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>材料审核工作结束后，入营名单将在6月25日左右学院主页上公布，学院主页网址：</span></p></section><section><p><span>http://energy.hust.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>五、时间安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>6月6日至6月20日：网上报名，实名加QQ咨询群：</span><strong><span>972097481</span></strong></p><p><span>6月25日左右：确认入营名单，并在学院网站公示</span></p><p><span>7月4日至7月6日：开展夏令营活动</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>六、激励政策</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院将为营员购买夏令营活动期间人身意外伤害保险、统一安排夏令营活动期间在汉食宿。外地营员如被我院推免时录取，其往返武汉的火车硬座硬卧（含高铁二等座）费用由学院承担(需出示票根报销)。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>七、日程安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/yCibibibY0L8iaPqgKuHABv37gYe4rMtL9L2mFK3Z8UvicyW2ia4l1ng592ia0DjL5DNJ5ZlTJhjWMhiaicehmc0mnFpfCQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>八、联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营联系人：李老师、何老师 联系电话：027-58868777（上班时间）</span></p><p><span>QQ咨询群：972097481</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>  - END -  </span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>来源：华中大能源学院</span></p><p><span><span>编辑：欧阳宇秋</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>审核：郑妮婷 王彩兰</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/yCibibibY0L8iaOpnVIp2icIiaw5DKicKhmxXVX30yZj692Ta3e3w44iaFJgCSZSBtib8sTUsl37kSz6MMib9rZD161129xg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"19dc1d216dd26d9178e02145ca366de625d4c17c9913360e5f0d4d482b35754a","textLength":1561,"sourceSha256":"895f024a9c1e9e9da2d18c99387d27bdd7388a353ffcaf9347c6222cc79b5653","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-df3325595bfa5b5ab4df","title":"2025年华中科技大学能源与动力工程学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:10.861635+00:00"}
